# The 2025 Schedule IT-2210, Underpayment of Estimated Tax by Individuals,
# and its instructions, the latest published. The 2026 schedule is not
# published, so the 2026 rules use this schedule's arithmetic with the 2026
# dates. One anchor per section the rules follow, and one per line whose
# rule the instructions spell out. Page numbers count the PDF's pages from 1.

